Alembic migration chain for the ITSM helpdesk.

The schema, the naming conventions, and the row that owns each table are
documented in docs/DATA_MODEL.md. Read that first.

Run from the backend/ directory:

    alembic upgrade head     apply every pending migration
    alembic current          show the revision the database is on
    alembic history          list the chain, oldest last
    alembic downgrade -1     step back one revision

The database URL is not in alembic.ini. env.py builds it from the
repository-root .env through app.core.config, so Compose and Alembic always
point at the same database.
